$DIR/test.p:4:2: i * i (value of type int) is not used
    The expression computes a value and throws it away, so it has no effect. A
    statement must do something: call a function, assign, send, and so on.
    Remove it, or assign the value to _ if computing it is the point.
    (see "Expression statements" in the Plutonium spec, section 12.4)
    (run "pluto explain E0100" for a longer explanation)
